WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.620
I see.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.450
Yuya Sakaki won.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.050
Yes.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:12.090
The Maiami Duel Association asked 
you to give him special permission

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.820
to enter the Junior Youth Championship.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:21.420
You allowed it, so why would he refuse?

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:26.170
It seems we didn't need to get involved.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:31.650
He chose to use his own strength 
to create his own destiny.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.400
That's why he's the pioneer of Pendulum.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.340
Did he use Pendulum again?

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.480
Yes.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:43.020
The control room detected the summoning.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.220
Did they detect any changes?

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.390
Changes to Pendulum Summon?

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.200
Nothing in particular.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:52.740
I see.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.880
That means he still hasn't...

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:06.850
President, it's not about Yuya Sakaki, but 
there's another topic that concerns me.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.340
Concerns you?

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:09.310
Yes.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:17.160
Recently, the Duel Control 
Room is frequently detecting

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.820
powerful Fusion Summons within Maiami City.

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.310
Fusion?

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:24.190
Since we're teaching Fusion at school,

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:29.100
I first thought the students 
were the cause.  However...

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:35.310
The energy you're detecting 
is too powerful, correct?

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:40.080
Yes.  Much more powerful than 
what any student can do.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.880
Understood.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:46.050
Tell the control room to 
continue their observations.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:54.510
First Xyz, now Fusion...

00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:02.230
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:07.150
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:10.410
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:14.410
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.190
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:36.600
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.340
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:49.910
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.110
Impulse  Got it got it

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:57.320
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:08.080
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:15.000
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:18.940
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:22.340
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:32.620
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.960
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:46.000
Two Shadows of Rebellion

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:54.450
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:59.690
I fuse Aria the Melodious Diva 
and Sonata the Melodious Diva!

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:05.660
Mysterious melodies, play a new 
harmony that causes flowers to bloom!

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.710
Fusion Summon!

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.310
Why is there an error?

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:16.270
Why can't I summon my Fusion Monster?  C'mon!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.760
Did you put your card in your Extra Deck?

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:21.740
Extra?

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:27.980
I told you many times that Fusion Monsters 
go into the Extra Deck instead of the deck.

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:30.850
Oh really?

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:53.540
You watched two of my duels up close.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.420
And you still didn't figure it out?

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:58.880
I could've beaten those two 
opponents without using Fusion,

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:02.570
but I did it so that you could learn.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.650
I'm sorry.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:10.970
Are you thinking about him again?

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.650
I knew it.

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:17.200
That's why you're not paying 
attention to dueling.

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:20.880
Who is he?

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:22.630
I don't know.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.110
What's his name?

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:25.880
I don't know.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.020
You said you met him twice.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:30.570
Yes.

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:32.400
I met him here the first time.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:34.910
Stay back.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.740
Who are you?

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:41.080
I don't want to hurt you anymore.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:44.970
And he stole your heart.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:47.770
What?  You're wrong!

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:50.540
I was a little excited.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.710
He seemed like an interesting guy.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:56.620
Who are you?

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:04.740
If Masumi Koutsu didn't interfere, 
I could've dueled him.

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:08.280
How disappointing.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:11.020
You shouldn't duel him!

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:11.940
Why not?

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:13.710
Because he's...

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:15.990
From the black darkness,

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:21.890
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.050
Xyz Summon!

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:29.200
Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:34.770
He's dangerous.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:40.490
It would make sense if there was an Action 
Duel Field using the Real Solid Vision System,

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:45.770
but why would there be a real 
explosion in a warehouse?

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.920
And why...

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:53.390
I don't want to hurt you anymore.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:56.360
Why would he say that to me?

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:17.880
I don't want to hurt anyone anymore!

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:20.110
Where's Ruri?

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.370
Damn!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.490
Ruri...

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.910
My bracelet again!

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.850
I knew I'd find you here!

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.220
Yuya!

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:52.340
Yuzu, come back to school.

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.800
The principal complains everyday.

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:00.800
Where am I?

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.850
Was I teleported again?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.850
He's strong.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:28.000
Syun...

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:42.510
Her bracelet glows?

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:46.850
Yeah.  She says that I always 
show up when it glows.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.420
There's no way that's true.

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:53.650
That bracelet is like a sensor to find you.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:56.740
Don't treat me like a lost pet.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:00.000
Hey, you're eating dinner here?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:05.580
Your sister's - I mean your 
mother's - cooking is delicious.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.480
You can call me sister.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:12.340
Besides, more the merrier.  
And I cooked a lot of food.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:14.530
So it's fine, right?

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:17.370
Are these that guy's recipes again?

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:21.270
Yes.  It's Michy's "Dishes 
that Make You Smarter."

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:24.750
I heard that your next 
duel was a brain battle,

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:27.770
so I tested my cooking skills 
using Michy's recipe.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.940
Eat up.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:33.200
Okay!  Thanks for the meal!

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:39.020
Chocolate on sardines?

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:46.340
Sardines have DHA that improve 
memory and concentration.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:51.930
The flavonoids in chocolate increase blood 
flow in the brain, so I think that's fine.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:54.740
Delicious!

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:57.880
Well, if you're okay with the taste...

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:02.880
Sora, do you know who your next opponent is?

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.340
Nope.

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:08.110
But I don't care because I won't lose.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:13.080
Don't let overconfidence lead you to defeat.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:14.740
Same to you.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.620
If you act like you have 
all the time in the world,

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:19.290
another man will steal Yuzu away from you.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.770
Another man?

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.220
She's not my girlfriend.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.270
Stop lying!

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:34.110
Like I said, you've had 
that bracelet since birth.

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:38.210
A baby can't be born wearing 
a bracelet on her wrist!

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:41.650
You weren't wearing it on your wrist.

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:43.140
I've had enough!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.080
Yuzu!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:55.540
I heard you're learning 
Fusion Summon from Sora.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:59.650
If you're training for the Junior Youth 
Championship, why won't you train here?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.600
Is my passionate teaching not enough?

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.640
Well?  Answer me!

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:11.140
Why does his face keep entering my mind?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:24.260
I have to master Fusion Summon as 
fast as possible and become stronger.

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:30.740
Or I will always be a 
burden to You Show School.

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:44.510
What's wrong with me?

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.740
What's this?

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:55.420
Someone anonymously sent them 
to our school this morning.

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.340
Marco and Tio.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:07.330
Why would the culprit send us cards 
of two of LDS's ace duelists?

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:15.020
Yesterday, we detected a powerful 
Xyz Summon within the city again.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:20.800
Right afterwards, I received 
word that Tio vanished.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.850
I never imagined that he 
was sealed inside a card.

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:26.320
Sealed?

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:29.140
That's actually possible?

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:32.000
Are they okay inside these cards?

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.540
They're still alive.

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:37.800
This is the first time that I've seen this.

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:44.270
But I can't say for certain 
without investigating.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:47.240
Is there a way to save them?

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:51.140
Not with our current capabilities.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:56.050
But one thing puzzles me.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:01.370
There have been three incidents so far.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:04.280
The first victim was Shingo Sawatari.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.910
But he wasn't sealed away.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:12.570
Marco was second and Tio was third, 
and they've been put inside cards.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:20.540
These two differing facts lead to the 
possibility that there are two culprits.

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:22.450
What?

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:24.510
Congressman, please wait!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:29.210
What is taking so long, Chairwoman Akaba?

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:30.850
Mr. Sawatari!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:32.680
You can't just barge in here!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:33.710
Please leave!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:35.020
Be quiet!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.200
I have business with the chairwoman!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.860
But you don't have an appointment!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:45.140
Isn't a politician allowed to meet the 
chariman of his election committee?

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:46.850
Nakajima, back off.

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:48.000
Yes sir.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.140
It seems there was another incident.

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:54.450
What are you talking about?

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:59.310
Since I'll be the next mayor, don't 
underestimate my information network!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:01.600
I heard about it!

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:08.280
Someone attacked this school's teacher, 
followed by one of LDS Top Team's aces!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.970
So it's true.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.970
Well...

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.400
It's true.

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:19.310
Then why are you doing nothing?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.340
Hurry up and arrest the culprit!

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:25.020
We are currently investigating 
who the culprit is.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.340
Investigating?

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:28.570
Why do you need to investigate?

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:36.020
My son testified that his 
attacker was Yuya Sakaki!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:42.120
Is your son still claiming that?

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:44.320
I haven't met him since he was discharged,

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:46.740
but I haven't heard that 
he changed his testimony.

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:50.200
Yuya Sakaki is definitely the culprit!

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:55.430
The Chairwoman agreed with me and said 
that she would handle everything.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:16:02.170
But you haven't done anything and left him 
alone, leading to a second and third incident!

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.620
I can't stay quiet any longer!

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:10.950
In order to protect Maiami City's safety, 
I'll have the police arrest Yuya Sakaki-

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.380
Please wait.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.110
I won't wait!

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.540
I said that we're still investigating.

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:23.460
We're not standing around doing nothing.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:28.930
We're using the combined efforts of Leo 
Corporation and LDS to pursue the culprit.

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:32.340
I said that the culprit is Yuya Sakaki!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.400
He isn't the culprit!

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:39.540
We promise to capture the real culprit.

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:43.080
Until then, stay quiet and observe.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.800
If you don't capture the 
culprit, I won't forgive you!

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:58.450
Nakajima, raise the city's 
alert level by one.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:02.050
Whoever sent these cards is challenging us.

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:04.910
Make sure we can deal with any situation.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:05.940
Yes sir.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:11.010
Give these cards to the Analysis 
Department and analyze them thoroughly.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:18.850
We must find a way to save these 
two- actually, all duelists.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.110
I'm sleepy.

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:27.770
I watched quiz shows until the morning.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:30.730
I was exercising my mind 
for the brain battle,

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:33.880
but I can't think clearly 
because of lack of sleep.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:38.100
You won't obey the next mayor's orders?

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:41.480
I am currently a city congressman!

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:44.110
I will eventually become Maiami City's mayor!

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:48.740
The mayor is the top person 
with the most authority!

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:49.820
Who is that?

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:52.140
City Congressman Sawatari.

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:53.420
Big talk from a wannabe mayor.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.990
Sawatari?

00:17:54.990 --> 00:18:01.600
LDS and Leo Corporation must obey my orders!

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:04.600
Not the Chairwoman's nor the President's!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:08.200
The next mayor's orders!  My orders!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.650
So that's Sylvio's father.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:14.670
Oops!  I can't dilly-dally 
or I won't meet Nico on time.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.350
That's...

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:22.550
That's Yuya Sakaki!

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:24.150
What are you doing?

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:26.600
The culprit is right there!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:28.150
Hurry up and capture him!

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.550
Won't you obey my orders?

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:31.850
Hurry up and go!

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:34.600
Capture Yuya Sakaki!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:37.060
Stop!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.100
What?

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:42.300
Why are they chasing me?

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:47.310
He assaulted my lovely 
son!  Don't let him escape!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:51.500
What?  It wasn't me!

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.950
Stop!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:03.420
LDS?  In that case, I'll take you on!

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:10.350
What's going on?

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:13.050
Who are you?  Don't interfere!

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.400
If you're not coming after 
me, I'm coming after you!

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:17.700
Is he the one?

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.400
The one who attacked Tio and Marco?

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.370
I'll contact headquarters!

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:26.800
Forget about him and grab Yuya Sakaki!

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:31.520
I summon Raidraptor - Vanishing 
Lanius from my hand!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:37.570
When I successfully summon this monster,

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:42.860
I can Special Summon another Raidraptor 
- Vanishing Lanius from my hand.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:52.000
I overlay three Level 4 Vanishing Lanius!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:53.850
There's no mistake!

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:55.600
He attacked the other two!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.450
Xyz Summon!

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:05.420
Xyz detected in the city's central area!

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:07.450
Energy is at maximum level!

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.600
It's comparable to what we detected before.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.650
Actually, it's more powerful!

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.400
Wakey wakey.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:07.340
What's wrong, Yuya?

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:10.870
Big trouble!  Xyz!  Xyz!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.800
What about Xyz Summon?

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:15.300
A behemoth!

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:18.550
A powerful monster appeared 
and blew everyone away!

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:22.450
Blown away?  Who?

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:25.630
Everyone who was chasing me!

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:26.580
Huh?

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:35.200
A monster that attacks people in 
the city instead of a Duel Stadium?

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:37.750
Maybe you were dreaming.

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:38.580
Dreaming?

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:42.280
Why were you taking a 
nap in this side street?

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:44.600
Sleeping?  Here?

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:46.500
You were sound asleep!

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:50.250
You're acting foolish before 
your important second match!

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:52.100
Let's go.

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:54.700
Your next opponent is waiting.

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:55.700
I'm sorry.

00:21:55.700 --> 00:21:57.400
I pulled an all-nighter.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:00.550
You shouldn't do that if 
you want to become a pro.

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:04.150
Maintaining your health is important.

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:18.940
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:28.420
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:40.430
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:45.670
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:51.110
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:56.370
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.570 --> 00:23:01.970
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:06.390
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:12.360
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:17.770
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.770 --> 00:23:23.100
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:32.440
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:40.660
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:54.200
Question: Sherlock Holmes was an 
expert on what musical instrument?

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:55.150
Solving mysteries!

00:23:55.150 --> 00:23:57.850
Incorrect!  Wrong again, Yuya.

00:23:57.850 --> 00:23:59.790
He said "musical instrument."

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:04.890
Even if I'm not good at trivia, that 
doesn't affect my entertainment dueling.

00:24:04.890 --> 00:24:06.630
We'll see about that.

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:07.500
What?

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:13.250
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
 Universe of Knowledge!!  Eita Kyuando

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:15.600
What's the answer to the trivia question?

00:24:15.600 --> 00:24:17.850
You'll find out next episode!
